<h1>Hello <%= @guest.name %>,</h1>
<p>
  Your <%= @service.service.name %> appointment with <%= @nutritionist.name %>
  (<%= @nutritionist.title %>) is confirmed for <%= @date %>, <%= @time %> – <%= @ends_at %>.
</p>
<p>
  It takes place at <%= @service.street %>, <%= @service.city %>.
</p>
<p>
  We look forward to seeing you then!
</p>
<p>
  Best regards,<br />
  <%= @nutritionist.name %>
</p>
